From: Andy Lutomirski <luto@amacapital.net>
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] x86: Clean up extable entry format (and free up a bit)
Date: Wed, 22 May 2013 14:07:41 -0700
Message-ID: <16644d9460fc6531456cf510d5efc57f89e5cd34.1369177867.git.luto@amacapital.net>
References: <cover.1369177867.git.luto@amacapital.net>
